  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "組織行為",
    "sub_ename": "ORGANIZATIONAL BEHAVIOR",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在研究人類行為，尤其是組織中各種行為背後的原因。 本課程的內容包括三個部分：個體行為、群體行為和組織體系。 了解人類行為及其原因將大大有助於管理者使組織有效。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims at human behaviors and, especially, reasons behind various behaviors in organizations. The contents of this course includes three parts ： individual behavior, group behavior, and organization system. To understand human behaviors and their reasons will give much help to managers for making organizations effective.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "理解並能夠解釋組織行為對商業公司和管理者的重要性。\r\n要知道重要的\r\n從個體行為、群體行為和組織系統等方面對組織的認識。\r\n有效地分析並能夠應用人際關係和人際交往能力來協助組織中的溝通和協調，以解決相關的OB問題。",
      "describe_en": "To comprehend and be able to explain the importance of Organizational Behavior to business firms and managers.\r\nTo know the important\r\nKnowledge in organizations from the aspects of individual behavior, group behavior and organization system.\r\nTo effectively analyze and be able to apply human relations and human skills to assist communication and coordination in an organization in order to solve related OB problems.\r\n"
    }
  ],
